--   **The axis facts, eventually.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.J6SegSideCost2`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem J6Seg.Side.axNum_ev (P : Prm) (hP : P.Ok) : ∃ n₁ : ℕ, ∀ n, n₁ ≤ n → ∀ src : ℕ → ℕ,
--       SrcOK6 P n src → ∀ D : ℕ, dP6 P n = D + 1 → ∀ k ≤ D, AxNum P n src D k
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Side costs 2: the sizes of one round-six axis
--
--   `AxNum P n src D k`: the natural-number facts the side costs need, on axis `k`
--   (`T = TP6`, `p = pP6`, `β = log₂ lg n`):
--   `pre · t · post = T`, `pre, post ≥ 1`, `p ≤ T`, `size (2T) ≤ p`, `Q ≤ 3p`, `log₂ λ ≤ 2β + 2`,
--   `pre · nc · λ · post ≤ T`, **`d · (pre · G · post) ≤ 99 T`**, `log₂ G ≤ ℓ ≤ p`, `G ≤ 3t`,
--   `d ≤ T`, `lg n < 2^(β+1)`.
--   `axNum_ev`: all of them for large `n`.
